error BYN1069: attribute `@foo` is not allowed before a statement

  1 │ @foo
    │ ^^^^ before a statement
    │
  help: remove the attribute; only `@unobservable` may come before a statement

error BYN8001: `@unobservable` bypasses a safety rule and needs `because "…"`

  5 │ @unobservable
    │ ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ bypasses a safety rule
    │
  help: explain the bypass in a `because` clause
